 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Ibrahim gets no motif. Geometric for «وسع ربي كل شيء علما» and «إن ربك حكيم عليم», light for «لهم الأمن وهم مهتدون», growth for «نرفع درجات». 80:14-23 (the exception «إلا أن يشاء ربي شيئا») is not glossed. 82: «بظلم» glossed with Al-Muyassar «بشرك»; As-Sa'di's fuller reading also starts from shirk. STAGING v4: c1 (80-81): Ibrahim (blue drop) and his people (3 men in dark robes) argue in a town: they speak (80:2), he answers, shakes his head on 80:10 (he does not fear their idols), points at them (80:24, 81:6); the idols are never drawn. Geometric for His knowledge (80:19), two paths for the two parties (81:16). c2 (82-83): As-Sa'di: 82 is Allah's verdict between the two parties; the scene stays on Ibrahim and his people, a light plate for security and guidance (82:8), growth for the raised degrees, geometric for His names. No glow, no bowing, no plate or zoom on the prophet's name."
 },
